{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete and five-axis review clean. Canonical activate is now a criterion-to-review-types mapping; project criteria can opt into plan_review, code_review, or both. Legacy lists infer gates from raw overlay routing maps without registry import-order dependence. Strict unknown-type, missing-route, malformed, and dangling activation errors remain. TDD RED was 6 intended failures / 37 passes; focused GREEN was 116 passes. Full make test: 7252 passed, 29 skipped, 114 deselected, 13 warnings in 26m33s. Final cleanup verification: 60 focused tests passed; make lint passed; mypy passed across 379 source files; git diff --check passed. Final review found no correctness, security, performance, maintainability, or test/documentation blockers."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785170346433837001,"uuid":"8aa3651a-2bb7-490b-b1e9-a5c6d393e1fb"}